PURPOSE of /kernel/wireless_tests/functional/connection/nmcli/wireless_connection_to_dynamic_WEP_TLS_AP
Description: Establish a wireless connection to a dynamic WEP w/ TLS AP using nmcli.
Author: Ken Benoit <kbenoit@redhat.com>
Test steps:
 * Choose which wireless interface to use and describe it
 * Disable the wired network interfaces
 * Configure the test wireless interface with a WEP IEEE8021X TLS connection using nmcli
 * Ping the gateway address to verify connection
 * Disable the wireless interface
 * Enable the wired network interfaces
